{"source":"github","project_id":"rstudio-conf-2022-program","target":"rstudio/rstudio-conf-2022-program","id":"pr/8","ref":8,"title":"Initial work to automate sched updating","description":"Primarily adds a manual workflow dispatch to update talks on sched. For now updating is initiated manually, if everything goes well we can make it automatic in the future.\r\n\r\nOne automated check is run on PRs to ensure that the YAML in the talk files is valid.\r\n\r\n- Moved scripts into `R/`\r\n- Added lightweight `renv.lock` via [capsule](https://github.com/MilesMcBain/capsule) (primarily used for GHA)\r\n- Extracted a few functions into `R/00_utils.R`\r\n- `sched_upsert()` now collects failures and reports them at the end\r\n- Speaker upsert failures are ignored for now until we resolve them manually","published_at":"2022-06-21T16:23:38Z","updated_at":"2022-06-21T16:46:25Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio-conf-2022-program/pull/8","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"gadenbuie","merged_at":"2022-06-21T16:46:25Z","state":"MERGED"}}
