{"source":"github","project_id":"rstudio-conf-2022-program","target":"rstudio/rstudio-conf-2022-program","id":"pr/3","ref":3,"title":"replace quarto journal articles talk with talk on quarto and jupyter notebooks","description":"[Nbdev](https://nbdev.fast.ai/) has integrated Quarto deeply into their notebook based development tools and offered to speak at conf about their work. We think this provides great perspective on both how Quarto works with Jupyter as well as how Quarto can be integrated into other tools and frameworks. \r\n\r\n\r\n","published_at":"2022-06-11T10:57:28Z","updated_at":"2022-06-13T20:07:44Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio-conf-2022-program/pull/3","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"jjallaire","merged_at":"2022-06-13T20:07:44Z","state":"MERGED"}}
